r of sample points. (P4) RESET DETECTION: Flag any point where the sequence reverses direction (e.g., indentation drops then climbs again). A single reset breaks monotonicity — candidates with zero resets form a strictly higher compliance tier than candidates with any resets, regardless of content quality."
